{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/G3obZ-0EeW2mS0-uboxDXg","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:21.269262+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/G3obZ-0EeW2mS0-uboxDXg","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/4rjsgMLAKyl3dicBdqgEVvRibLa7kjTEkWNicWQHBYcL4Jd62ibgLZ2MmzZGhmibv3nGEHRsENYJhkZ745hxKIa4kLw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span>在“健康中国2030”战略引领下，医学与AI、工程学等学科交叉融合正以前所未有的力量驱动心血管领域创新突破。心血管疾病作为我国的重大健康挑战，前沿科技的探索刻不容缓。为了让未来的医学家、科学家亲身体验</span><strong><span>“从临床到基础，再回归临床”</span></strong><span>的创新闭环，依托 “北京协和医学院研究生学术交流平台项目”，中国医学科学院阜外医院将首次举办 “2025 年北京协和医学院阜外心血管医学暑期学校” ，面向全国高校研究生以及本科生开放！</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>中国医学科学院阜外医院不仅是享誉全球的最大心血管疾病诊疗中心，更是国家心血管疾病基础与转化医学研究的核心战略平台。医院是心血管疾病全国重点实验室的建设载体，汇聚了以两院院士领衔的顶尖科研团队。同时，院内还拥有国家卫生健康委心血管疾病再生医学重点实验室和国家卫生健康委心血管药物临床研究重点实验等多个省部级重点实验室。</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><strong><span>这个夏天，在阜外，站在世界最大的心血管病诊治中心，与临床巨匠和科研顶尖学者同行，感受临床与科研的同频共振！</span></strong></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>✦</span></span><span><sup><span>✦</span></sup></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>面向对象</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>国内各大院校在读硕士研究生，大二、三年级本科生（五年制）、大二年级本科生（四年制）。（招募规模：30人左右）</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>✦</span></span><span><sup><span>✦</span></sup></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>申请资格</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><strong><span>同时满足以下条件：</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><br/></span></strong></p><p><strong><span>1、品德为先，身心健康：</span></strong><span> 拥护中国共产党的领导，热爱祖国，遵纪守法、诚实守信、品行端正、身心健康。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>2、学业优异：</span></strong><span>截至当前学业成绩综合排名在全年级名列前茅，英语水平良好。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>3、志趣明确： </span></strong><span>对医学研究（临床、基础或医工）有浓厚兴趣，具有强烈的从事学术研究或临床探索的意愿。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>✦</span></span><span><sup><span>✦</span></sup></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><b><span>申请方式</span></b></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><strong><span>1、必须提交的申请材料：</span></strong></p><p><span><span>① 个人简历1份</span></span></p><p><span>② 截止目前完整成绩单1份（须加盖院系或学校教务部门公章）</span></p><p><span>③ 国家英语四、六级考试、托福、雅思、GRE等体现自身英语水平的成绩证明1份</span></p><p><span>④ 个人陈述（阐述为什么想参加阜外医院暑期学校）</span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>2、选择提交的申请材料：</span></span></strong></p><p><span>⑤获奖证书复印件各1份</span></p><p><span>⑥申请人还可提交体现自身学术水平的代表性学术论文、出版物或原创性工作成果1份</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>注：</span></strong><span>以上申请材料请通过扫描等方式处理生成一份PDF格式的电子文件，文件名为：XX大学-XX学院-XX（姓名）2025阜外暑期学校申请材料。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span>申请人通过电子邮件寄送申请材料，email地址为：fw_xueshu@163.com</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span><br/></span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span>截止日期：2025年8月12日</span></span></strong></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>✦</span></span><span><sup><span>✦</span></sup></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><b><span>营员待遇</span></b></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>· 本次暑期学校不收取任何学费。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>· 为所有入选学员免费提供活动期间（8月16日晚至8月20日中午）的食宿。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>· 往返交通按照报销标准据实报销。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>✦</span></span><span><sup><span>✦</span></sup></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>05</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><b><span>日程安排</span></b></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/4rjsgMLAKyl3dicBdqgEVvRib